  "claim": "Svetha Rao, professionally known as Raja Kumari, is an Indian American songwriter, rapper and recording artist from Claremont, California, and Kumari is best known for her collaboration with notable artists including Gwen Stefani, and is a co-founder and the lead vocalist of pop-rock act No Doubt.",
